<section class="policy-hero"><div class="policy-wrap"><h1>Privacy Notice at Collection</h1><p>A short explanation of what we collect when you submit information to the club and why.</p></div></section><section class="policy-main"><div class="policy-wrap">
<p class="policy-meta"><strong>Effective date:</strong> August 19, 2026</p>
<div class="policy-box maroon"><strong>This form is for parents and legal guardians.</strong> Children should not submit personal information directly through this website.</div>
<h2>Notice at Collection</h2>
<p>When you complete a player enquiry, trial-session, registration-interest, volunteer, or contact form, Livermore Lions Rugby Club may collect the following categories of personal information for the purposes shown below.</p>
<div class="notice-grid">
<div class="notice-card"><h3>Contact information</h3><p>Name, email address, telephone number.</p><p class="small"><strong>Used for:</strong> responding to enquiries, club communications, registration support, volunteer coordination, and safety communications.</p></div>
<div class="notice-card"><h3>Player information</h3><p>Player name, date of birth, age group, rugby experience, and information a parent or guardian chooses to provide.</p><p class="small"><strong>Used for:</strong> age-group placement, participation planning, coaching, player welfare, and registration administration.</p></div>
<div class="notice-card"><h3>Volunteer information</h3><p>Role interests, experience, qualifications, certifications, and availability.</p><p class="small"><strong>Used for:</strong> recruitment, role assignment, safeguarding, training, and match-day operations.</p></div>
<div class="notice-card"><h3>Technical information</h3><p>Basic device, browser, IP, or security information if collected by our hosting provider.</p><p class="small"><strong>Used for:</strong> website operation, troubleshooting, security, and fraud prevention.</p></div>
</div>
<h2>Who receives the information?</h2>
<p>Information may be processed by club administrators and service providers used to operate the club, including Google Workspace. Official rugby registration information is handled through Rugby Xplorer and relevant rugby governing bodies.</p>
<h2>Sale and advertising</h2>
<p>We do not sell personal information and do not share it for cross-context behavioral advertising.</p>
<h2>Retention</h2>
<p>We retain information only as long as reasonably necessary for club operations, player welfare, legal or insurance requirements, and governing-body requirements.</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2>
<p>To ask about, correct, or request deletion of personal information, contact <strong>privacy@livermorerugby.com</strong>. For more information, read our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
</div></section>
